@startuml
title GitHub Repository Synchronization Sequence

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

participant "Scheduler" as Scheduler
participant "GitHub Connector" as Connector
participant "GitHub API" as GitHub
participant "Document Service" as Document
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
database "Google Cloud Storage" as GCS
participant "Ingestion Service" as Ingestion
database "Firestore\nRegistry" as Registry

Scheduler -> Connector : Trigger scheduled sync
activate Connector

Connector -> GitHub : Get changed files
activate GitHub
GitHub --> Connector : Repository files
deactivate GitHub

loop For each modified file

    Connector -> GitHub : Download source file
    activate GitHub
    GitHub --> Connector : File content
    deactivate GitHub

    Connector -> Document : Register document
    activate Document

    Document -> Storage : Store file
    activate Storage

    Storage -> GCS : Upload object
    activate GCS
    GCS --> Storage : Object URI
    deactivate GCS

    Storage --> Document : Storage location
    deactivate Storage

    Document -> Registry : Save metadata
    activate Registry
    Registry --> Document : Metadata saved
    deactivate Registry

    Document -> Ingestion : Trigger ingestion
    activate Ingestion
    Ingestion --> Document : Accepted
    deactivate Ingestion

    Document --> Connector : Registration successful
    deactivate Document

end

Connector --> Scheduler : Synchronization completed
deactivate Connector

@enduml